# NHS Dentist Intelligence — environment variables
#
# Nothing here is required. A fresh clone installs, tests and captures without
# any of it. Names only — never commit a real value to this public repo.

# Referenced by .github/workflows/snapshot.yml, but read by no code in this
# repo. The NHS Service Search API route is not implemented (see ADR-002);
# `ingest/fetch.py --route api` exits with an error. The nightly capture uses
# --route auto, which resolves to the nhs.uk HTML route and succeeds without
# a key. The repo has no secrets set, and that is deliberate.
# NHS_API_KEY=

# Used only by tools/push_via_python.py, an operational workaround script
# (see ADR-003). Not part of the ingest or analysis pipeline.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=
